/*
features
--------

A map of Dev Container Feature IDs (see https://containers.dev/features) and
their configuration options to be added to your main container.

Each feature supports its own set of options—check the feature’s
documentation for specifics.

Example:
"features": {
  "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/docker-in-docker:2": {}
}
*/

{
  "name": "1_16-spec_features",
  "image": "ubuntu:latest",
  "features": {
    "ghcr.io/devcontainers/features/docker-in-docker:2": {}
  }
}
